<title>USA: DynEco gets cooling subcontract.</title>
<headline>DynEco gets cooling subcontract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DynEco Corp said Tuesday it won a subcontract from Balimoy Manufacturing Co to supply an Orbital Vane cooling compressor and related engineering services to be used in a protytype lightweight auxiliary power unit being developed for the U.S. Army.</p>
<p>DynEco's five cubic inch displacement Orbital Vane compressor is designed to provide cooling for the electronic equipment and personnel operating that equipment from the vehicle containing auxiliary power.</p>
<p>The value of the subcontract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
